'''Hiroshi Mihara''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained when beating any stage in [[Shiryouko's Photography Studio|Chasing Dream Idols]] during the [[Hiroshi Mihara Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]] and is based on the Japanese YouTuber who lives in Taiwan, named [https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCBq7s8VOCyek275uvq5lYQ 三原慧悟] (''Hiroshi Mihara''). [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]] increases chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies.

{{Cat Info
